<title>NETHERLANDS: Gilissen raises CSM to Buy from Hold.</title>
<headline>Gilissen raises CSM to Buy from Hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dec 30 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>CSM NV	    Foods	   95.40   Th. Gilissen Bankiers</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy from Hold.</p>
<p>Acquisition of U.S. Karp's Inc (bakery, food ingredients) seen strengthening ingredients division, with sales rising to Dfl 1.5 billion, 43 pct of total group sales, in 1997. Substantial synergy benefits. CSM should now resume 11-15 pct growth. Higher profit growth and multiple expansion make CSM a very attractive investment at the moment.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995/96 (actual)   5.17     n/a     18.45     1.60</p>
<p>    1996/97		5.95     5.85     n/a	n/a</p>
<p>    1997/98		6.75     n/a	n/a	n/a</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
